        <title type="html"><![CDATA[unmodifiableList와 ImmutableList]]></title>
        <id>https://hyoyoonnam.github.io/difference-between-collections-unmodifiablelist-and-List-of-immutablelist</id>
        <link href="https://hyoyoonnam.github.io/difference-between-collections-unmodifiablelist-and-List-of-immutablelist"/>
        <updated>2026-03-13T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[1. '수정이 불가능한' 컬렉션과 '불변' 컬렉션의 차이를 view와 capture로 설명할 수 있어요.]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-note admonition_xJq3 alert alert--secondary"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.3 5.69a.942.942 0 0 1-.28-.7c0-.28.09-.52.28-.7.19-.18.42-.28.7-.28.28 0 .52.09.7.28.18.19.28.42.28.7 0 .28-.09.52-.28.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7.3c-.28 0-.52-.11-.7-.3zM8 7.99c-.02-.25-.11-.48-.31-.69-.2-.19-.42-.3-.69-.31H6c-.27.02-.48.13-.69.31-.2.2-.3.44-.31.69h1v3c.02.27.11.5.31.69.2.2.42.31.69.31h1c.27 0 .48-.11.69-.31.2-.19.3-.42.31-.69H8V7.98v.01zM7 2.3c-3.14 0-5.7 2.54-5.7 5.68 0 3.14 2.56 5.7 5.7 5.7s5.7-2.55 5.7-5.7c0-3.15-2.56-5.69-5.7-5.69v.01zM7 .98c3.86 0 7 3.14 7 7s-3.14 7-7 7-7-3.12-7-7 3.14-7 7-7z"></path></svg></span>이 글을 읽으면</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><ol>
<li class="">
<p>'수정이 불가능한' 컬렉션과 '불변' 컬렉션의 차이를 view와 capture로 설명할 수 있어요.</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>다음 두 코드로 생성한 컬렉션 객체의 차이를 알 수 있어요.</p>
<ul>
<li class=""><code>Collections.unmodifiableList()</code></li>
<li class=""><code>List.of()</code> 또는 <code>List.copyOf()</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol></div></div>
<p>수정 메서드를 호출하면 <code>UnsupportedOperationException</code> 예외가 발생한다.</p>
<iframe frameborder="0" src="https://onecompiler.com/java/44gg6wqev?codeEditors=true&amp;hideNew=true&amp;hideNewFile=true" width="100%" height="600px" title="Unmodifiable vs Immutable List Java Example"></iframe>
<h1>2. 차이점</h1>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="21-구현체-클래스가-다르다">2.1. 구현체 클래스가 다르다<a href="https://hyoyoonnam.github.io/difference-between-collections-unmodifiablelist-and-List-of-immutablelist#21-%EA%B5%AC%ED%98%84%EC%B2%B4-%ED%81%B4%EB%9E%98%EC%8A%A4%EA%B0%80-%EB%8B%A4%EB%A5%B4%EB%8B%A4" class="hash-link" aria-label="2.1. 구현체 클래스가 다르다에 대한 직접 링크" title="2.1. 구현체 클래스가 다르다에 대한 직접 링크" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<iframe frameborder="0" src="https://onecompiler.com/java/44gh4m5rq?codeEditors=true&amp;hideNew=true&amp;hideNewFile=true" width="100%" height="600px" title="Unmodifiable vs Immutable List Java Example"></iframe>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="22-원본-컬렉션과의-관계성이-다르다">2.2. 원본 컬렉션과의 관계성이 다르다<a href="https://hyoyoonnam.github.io/difference-between-collections-unmodifiablelist-and-List-of-immutablelist#22-%EC%9B%90%EB%B3%B8-%EC%BB%AC%EB%A0%89%EC%85%98%EA%B3%BC%EC%9D%98-%EA%B4%80%EA%B3%84%EC%84%B1%EC%9D%B4-%EB%8B%A4%EB%A5%B4%EB%8B%A4" class="hash-link" aria-label="2.2. 원본 컬렉션과의 관계성이 다르다에 대한 직접 링크" title="2.2. 원본 컬렉션과의 관계성이 다르다에 대한 직접 링크" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="unmodifiablelist">UnmodifiableList<a href="https://hyoyoonnam.github.io/difference-between-collections-unmodifiablelist-and-List-of-immutablelist#unmodifiablelist" class="hash-link" aria-label="UnmodifiableList에 대한 직접 링크" title="UnmodifiableList에 대한 직접 링크" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p><code>UnmodifiableRandomAccessList</code> 구현체(이하 <code>UnmodifiableList</code>)는 원본 컬렉션에 대한 <strong>view</strong>이다.</p>
<p>다음처럼 원본 컬렉션인 <code>list</code>를 필드로 가지고, 외부에서 컬렉션 메서드를 호출하면 그대로 <code>list.method()</code>를 대신 호출하여 리턴하는 프록시에 불과하다.</p>
<p>따라서, 원본 컬렉션인 list의 참조를 <code>x001</code>, view(또는 프록시)인 UnmodifiableList의 참조를 <code>x002</code>라고 한다면 <code>x002.add()</code>는 불가능하고 <code>x001.add()</code>는 가능하다.</p>
<p>또한 <code>x001</code>에 변화가 생기면, 이를 필드로 가지는 <code>x002</code>에도 반영된다.</p>
<div class="language-java codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-java codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">static</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">class</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name">UnmodifiableList</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&lt;</span><span class="token generics class-name">E</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&gt;</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">extends</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name">UnmodifiableCollection</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&lt;</span><span class="token generics class-name">E</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&gt;</span><span class="token plain">  </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">                              </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">implements</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name">List</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&lt;</span><span class="token generics class-name">E</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&gt;</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">{</span><span class="token plain">  </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">final</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name">List</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&lt;</span><span class="token generics operator" style="color:#393A34">?</span><span class="token generics"> </span><span class="token generics keyword" style="color:#00009f">extends</span><span class="token generics"> </span><span class="token generics class-name">E</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&gt;</span><span class="token plain"> list</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">;</span><span class="token plain">  </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token class-name">UnmodifiableList</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token class-name">List</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&lt;</span><span class="token generics operator" style="color:#393A34">?</span><span class="token generics"> </span><span class="token generics keyword" style="color:#00009f">extends</span><span class="token generics"> </span><span class="token generics class-name">E</span><span class="token generics punctuation" style="color:#393A34">&gt;</span><span class="token plain"> list</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">{</span><span class="token plain">  </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">super</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token plain">list</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">;</span><span class="toke